# WP23: pak chunks by world region - a copy of WP_Protocol at ChunkRegionSize 20000 cm (200 m regions), packaged.
# The copy streams around the plane 9000002 (Scripts/World/WPFly.lua: 125 m/s along +X for 8 s = 1 km, five
# regions) with the Player's source off, as WP-SRC-VELOCITY - so regions behind it lose their last cell.
# WP_Protocol states 100000 cm already: one undo returns the field to 100000 (the value before the edit), not 0.
# Package Game bundles build/Bin/<PackageConfig>/Runtime (~/.desertengine/editor.json): Debug for this proof,
# because a Shipping Runtime refuses --shot.
# After PASS, outside the editor (the scenario drives the editor only):
#   [wp23_paks]   PakTool list on the package's Chunk_World_*.dpak -> several _R<x>_<y> + _Shared
#   [wp23_stream] the packaged Runtime --scene Content/Scenes/WP23_Protocol.desce --shot <png> --shot-frames 900:
#                 log "[VFS] Mounted ..._R.." as the plane enters a region, "Unmounted ... (on demand again)" after.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
# A partitioned world saves as a copy only whole (594 of 601 entities live in unloaded cells otherwise).
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано save-as WP23_Protocol
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано run Panel "Open World Settings"
Когда set world WorldPartition.ChunkRegionSize 20000
Тогда wp23_field World Settings > World Partition: Chunk Region Size (cm) = 20000
Когда run Action "Undo"
Тогда wp23_field_undo одна отмена: поле снова 100000 (значение до правки)
Когда run Action "Redo"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Build "Package Game"
Тогда wp23_package пакет собран; в логе «[Package] world '…WP23_Protocol…' divided into '…_Shared' + N region chunk(s)», N > 1
